{"id": null, "n": "0878011", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0878011", "type": "mod", "text": "天【大】，大【宋】【元】【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0878012", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0878012", "type": "mod", "text": "六【大】，佛說六【宋】【元】【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0878001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0878001", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】麗本，【甲】天平時代寫西福寺藏本，（佛說）＋六【元】【明】【甲】"}
